{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "CosmosAI learning export", "elements": [{"id": "title", "type": "text", "x": 60, "y": 40, "width": 760, "height": 38, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 36001, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 3600101, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1786200000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a0", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Milestone 36: Tiny PyTorch Evaluation Proof", "fontSize": 30, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Milestone 36: Tiny PyTorch Evaluation Proof", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "subtitle", "type": "text", "x": 65, "y": 90, "width": 1040, "height": 40, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#495057", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 36002, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 3600202, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1786200000000, "link": "/learn/concepts/", "locked": false, "index": "a1", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Evaluation means: use current trained weights to predict, measure loss/accuracy, and do not update weights.", "fontSize": 16, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Evaluation means: use current trained weights to predict, measure loss/accuracy, and do not update weights.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "flow", "type": "text", "x": 70, "y": 160, "width": 1180, "height": 290, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#fff3bf", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 36003, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 3600303, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1786200000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a2", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Command-line sequence\n\nmain()\n  -> load_dataset_splits_from_manifest(...)\n  -> run_torch_training_loop(..., model=loop_model)\n       training updates weights on train samples\n  -> evaluate_torch_model(dataset_splits, loop_model)\n       read-only metrics on train, val, test\n  -> print_torch_evaluation_results(...)\n       terminal output explains accuracy/loss", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Command-line sequence\n\nmain()\n  -> load_dataset_splits_from_manifest(...)\n  -> run_torch_training_loop(..., model=loop_model)\n       training updates weights on train samples\n  -> evaluate_torch_model(dataset_splits, loop_model)\n       read-only metrics on train, val, test\n  -> print_torch_evaluation_results(...)\n       terminal output explains accuracy/loss", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "train-box", "type": "text", "x": 70, "y": 500, "width": 360, "height": 220, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#d3f9d8", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 36004, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 3600404, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1786200000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a3", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Training loop\n\nrun_torch_training_loop()\n\nConcept:\nforward -> loss -> backward -> optimizer.step()\n\nThis is where weights change.", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Training loop\n\nrun_torch_training_loop()\n\nConcept:\nforward -> loss -> backward -> optimizer.step()\n\nThis is where weights change.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "eval-box", "type": "text", "x": 470, "y": 500, "width": 380, "height": 220, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#d0ebff", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 36005, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 3600505, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1786200000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a4", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Evaluation split\n\nevaluate_torch_split()\n\nConcept:\nmodel.eval() + torch.no_grad()\n\nForward pass only.\nNo gradient calculation.\nNo weight update.", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Evaluation split\n\nevaluate_torch_split()\n\nConcept:\nmodel.eval() + torch.no_grad()\n\nForward pass only.\nNo gradient calculation.\nNo weight update.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "metrics-box", "type": "text", "x": 890, "y": 500, "width": 390, "height": 220, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#ffe3e3", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 36006, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 3600606, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1786200000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a5", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Metrics output\n\nprint_torch_evaluation_results()\n\naccuracy = correct / samples\nloss = how wrong the true label score was\n\nN/A accuracy means no samples.", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Metrics output\n\nprint_torch_evaluation_results()\n\naccuracy = correct / samples\nloss = how wrong the true label score was\n\nN/A accuracy means no samples.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}, {"id": "current-output", "type": "text", "x": 70, "y": 770, "width": 980, "height": 190, "angle": 0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "backgroundColor": "#f1f3f5", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "seed": 36007, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 3600707, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1786200000000, "link": null, "locked": false, "index": "a6", "hasTextLink": false, "text": "Current tiny result\n\ntrain: samples=1, correct=1, accuracy=1.0000, average_loss=1.0440\nval: samples=0, accuracy=N/A\ntest: samples=0, accuracy=N/A\n\nMeaning: the evaluation mechanism works, but real validation/test quality is not known yet.", "fontSize": 20, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Current tiny result\n\ntrain: samples=1, correct=1, accuracy=1.0000, average_loss=1.0440\nval: samples=0, accuracy=N/A\ntest: samples=0, accuracy=N/A\n\nMeaning: the evaluation mechanism works, but real validation/test quality is not known yet.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": false, "rawText": ""}], "appState": {"viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"}, "files": {}}